  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tienes toda la pinta de ser de Ciudad Luminalia,\n¿o me equivoco?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400690065006E0065007300200074006F006400610020006C0061002000700069006E00740061002000640065002000730065007200200064006500200043006900750064006100640020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C00690061002C000A00BF006F0020006D0065002000650071007500690076006F0063006F003F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espero que no te importe que te pregunte esto,\npero no llevarás contigo un Slowpoke, ¿no?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A ver, te explico bien.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYo vengo de Galar y ahí los Slowpoke tienen\nla cabeza y la punta de la cola amarillas, como<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npuedes ver en mi compañero de aquí.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 162
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero me dijeron que en otros lugares no es así.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000650072006F0020006D0065002000640069006A00650072006F006E002000710075006500200065006E0020006F00740072006F00730020006C0075006700610072006500730020006E006F00200065007300200061007300ED002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ahora es posible encontrar Slowpoke salvajes\nen Ciudad Luminalia, ¿no es verdad?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pues me encantaría hacerme amigo de algún\nSlowpoke de los de aquí.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500075006500730020006D006500200065006E00630061006E00740061007200ED0061002000680061006300650072006D006500200061006D00690067006F00200064006500200061006C006700FA006E000A0053006C006F00770070006F006B00650020006400650020006C006F0073002000640065002000610071007500ED002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te importaría traerme uno? Si quieres te lo\npuedo cambiar por mi Slowpoke de Galar.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me encantaría volver a casa con uno de\nlos Slowpoke que se pueden encontrar<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nen Ciudad Luminalia.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te cambio mi Slowpoke de Galar por uno local?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00540065002000630061006D00620069006F0020006D006900200053006C006F00770070006F006B0065002000640065002000470061006C0061007200200070006F007200200075006E006F0020006C006F00630061006C003F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Claro!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006C00610072006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, lo siento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020006C006F0020007300690065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué bien! Vamos a intercambiar.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10051007500E90020006200690065006E0021002000560061006D006F00730020006100200069006E00740065007200630061006D0062006900610072002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo que tú no dejaría pasar esta oportunidad.\nLos Slowpoke de Galar son una rareza aquí.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, a ver, yo lo que quiero es un Slowpoke\nde los que no se pueden encontrar en Galar.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Guaaaau! ¡Si hasta huele distinto!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100470075006100610061006100750021002000A1005300690020006800610073007400610020006800750065006C0065002000640069007300740069006E0074006F002100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Pero es normal que sea así de grande?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF005000650072006F0020006500730020006E006F0072006D0061006C0020007100750065002000730065006100200061007300ED0020006400650020006700720061006E00640065003F002100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya sabía que tenía otro aspecto, pero no\nme esperaba esta diferencia de tamaño.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Slooow?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0053006C006F006F006F0077003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ja, ja, pero esa cara bobalicona la reconocería\nen cualquier lugar. ¡Un Slowpoke es un Slowpoke,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsea de donde sea!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te agradezco mucho que me hayas traído\nun Slowpoke tan bonito!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005400650020006100670072006100640065007A0063006F0020006D007500630068006F00200071007500650020006D0065002000680061007900610073002000740072006100ED0064006F000A0075006E00200053006C006F00770070006F006B0065002000740061006E00200062006F006E00690074006F002100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por lo que me dijeron, cuando evolucionan,\nlas diferencias se hacen incluso más obvias.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No sé si lo sabes, pero el Slowbro de Galar es\nde tipo Veneno, y...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020007300E90020007300690020006C006F002000730061006200650073002C0020007000650072006F00200065006C00200053006C006F007700620072006F002000640065002000470061006C00610072002000650073000A006400650020007400690070006F002000560065006E0065006E006F002C00200079002E002E002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Bueno, no quiero arruinarte la sorpresa!\nTe dejo que lo descubras por tu cuenta.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Espero que cuides muy bien del Slowpoke\nde Galar!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100450073007000650072006F002000710075006500200063007500690064006500730020006D007500790020006200690065006E002000640065006C00200053006C006F00770070006F006B0065000A00640065002000470061006C00610072002100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Muchas gracias por traerme un Slowpoke tan\nbonito. ¡Cuida muy bien de mi Slowpoke de Galar!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3688,
